From: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] Build and test MDS with only production-build development tools

Keep production dependencies and application code unchanged.
Add the missing DOM testing peer, use Jest CommonJS interop, and bound
minifier workers. Preserve all four upstream Button assertions.

